  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "A particle of mass ' $m$ ' is projected with a velocity $v$ making an angle of $30^{\\circ}$ with the horizontal. The magnitude of angular momentum of the projectile about the point of projection when the particle is at its maximum height ' $h$ ' is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "17y8j",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\frac{m v^{2}}{g}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "oPiL7",
      "text": "zero",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d3tiU",
      "text": "$\\frac{m v^{3}}{\\sqrt{2 g}}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "BGs36",
      "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{16} \\frac{m v^{3}}{g}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Angular momentum $L_{0}=p r_{\\perp}$ $\\left(\\because\\right.$ linear momentum $p=m v \\cos \\theta$ and $\\left.\\mathrm{r}_{1}=H\\right)$\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/nZ84PuGwoTRtrwb2Py798AbqUV7RMNwWKZjAOgiqSiM.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow L_{0}=m v \\cos \\theta H$\r\n\r\n$=m v \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\cdot \\frac{v^{2} \\sin ^{2} 30^{\\circ}}{2 g}$\r\n\r\n$=\\frac{\\sqrt{3} m v^{3}}{16 g}$",
    "image": null
  },
